@startuml
[*] --> Start Sharing
Start Sharing --> Selecting Group : select group
Selecting Group --> Selecting Content : select content
Selecting Content --> Setting Time Frame : set time frame
Setting Time Frame --> Sharing Successful : share
Sharing Successful --> Content Available : display "Photo shared successfully"
Content Available --> Content Unavailable : time limit reached
Content Unavailable --> [*]
@enduml
